{"timestamp": "2026-02-04 18:58:54.927838", "event": "llm_start", "messages": "content='Based on the diagnosis report: ### Troubleshooting Diagnosis Report\\n\\n#### Network Health Overview:\\nThe network appears to be experiencing significant issues with reachability between hosts. The ping results indicate that communication between key components of the network is currently in an \"unknown\" state, suggesting that either the ping tests failed to execute properly or there is a fundamental issue preventing connectivity.\\n\\n#### Observations:\\n1. **Reachability Tests:**\\n   - **Client to Web Server (`client_0` to `webserver0_pod0`):**\\n     - Status: Unknown\\n     - No data on transmitted packets, received packets, or round-trip times.\\n   - **DNS Server to Web Server (`dns_pod0` to `webserver0_pod0`):**\\n     - Status: Unknown\\n     - No data on transmitted packets, received packets, or round-trip times.\\n   - **DNS Server to Client (`dns_pod0` to `client_0`):**\\n     - Status: Unknown\\n     - No data on transmitted packets, received packets, or round-trip times.\\n   - **Web Server to Client (`webserver0_pod0` to `client_0`):**\\n     - Status: Unknown\\n     - No data on transmitted packets, received packets, or round-trip times.\\n\\n2. **Host IP Addresses:**\\n   - `client_0`: 10.2.1.8\\n   - `webserver0_pod0`: 10.0.1.2\\n   - `dns_pod0`: 10.0.0.2\\n\\n#### Implications:\\nThe lack of reachability between hosts indicates a potential issue in the routing or forwarding configuration within the Clos network. This could stem from:\\n- Misconfigured BGP sessions between routers.\\n- Incorrect IP routing tables.\\n- Network interface or link failures.\\n- Service or application-level issues on the hosts.\\n\\n#### Next Steps:\\nTo further diagnose the root cause, the following areas should be investigated:\\n1. **Router Configurations:**\\n   - Verify BGP configurations and session states on all routers.\\n   - Check IP routing tables for anomalies.\\n2. **Host Network Configurations:**\\n   - Inspect the network settings (IP addresses, routes, etc.) on `client_0`, `dns_pod0`, and `webserver0_pod0`.\\n3. **Service Status:**\\n   - Confirm the operational status of DNS and HTTP services on the respective hosts.\\n4. **Link and Interface Status:**\\n   - Examine the status of network interfaces and links between routers and hosts.\\n\\nThis report highlights the current state of the network and identifies areas requiring further investigation to pinpoint the root cause of the connectivity issues., please provide the submission. Do not submit if no report available.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={} id='7aad4330-e579-477b-af23-0bcd75e178a8'", "model": {"lc": 1, "type": "constructor", "id": ["langchain", "chat_models", "openai", "ChatOpenAI"], "kwargs": {"model_name": "kt-gpt-oss-rh014", "temperature": 0.0, "openai_api_key": {"lc": 1, "type": "secret", "id": ["OPENAI_API_KEY"]}, "openai_api_base": "https://dev.kora.kt.co.kr/v2", "request_timeout": 180.0, "max_retries": 2}, "name": "ChatOpenAI"}}
